<a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/apple-music/">Apple Music</a> is teaming up with Goldenvoice to livestream the <a href="https://headtripindio.com">Head Trip music festival</a> that's taking place in Indio, California, on October 10 and 11.<br/>
<br/>
<img src="https://images.macrumors.com/article-new/2024/08/apple-music.jpg" alt="" width="1920" height="1080" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-962031" /><br/>
Head Trip will feature Calvin Harris, Fisher with Chris Lake, Peggy Gou with Four Tet, Swedish House Mafia, Skrillex, Dom Dolla with Kettama, and more. Tickets to the in-person event started at &#36;499 but have sold out, and only passes starting at &#36;589 are available now.<br/>
